      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); line-height: 1.2; color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Zanzibar Packing List 2026 — Complete Guide for Every Traveler Type</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #5c727f; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">Beach essentials, Stone Town cultural dress codes, health items, tech gear, and specialized lists for families, couples, divers, and kitesurfers.</p>
