    <section style="background: #f0f9ff; border-left: 4px solid #005f8a; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; color: #003853; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Golden Rule: Pack Light, Pack Smart</h2>
      <p style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Zanzibar is hot, humid, and casual. Laundry is cheap and everywhere. You need half of what you think.</p>
      <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
        <li><strong>Laundry:</strong> Every hotel/guesthouse offers same-day wash & fold for ~$1–2/kg</li>
        <li><strong>Shopping:</strong> Forgot something? Stone Town, Nungwi, and Paje have everything (sunscreen, hats, swimwear, pharmacy)</li>
        <li><strong>Weight:</strong> Domestic flights (ZNZ ↔ mainland) often have 15–20kg limits. Pack accordingly.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.8rem; color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 1rem;">The Universal Essentials (Everyone Needs These)</h2>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem;">
        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">☀️ Sun & Skin Protection</h3>
          <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
            <li><strong>Reef-safe sunscreen SPF 50+</strong> (2+ bottles — expensive locally)</li>
            <li>Wide-brim hat (packable/crushable)</li>
            <li>Polarized sunglasses (UV400)</li>
            <li>After-sun aloe vera gel</li>
            <li>Lip balm SPF 30+</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">👕 Clothing Basics (7–10 days)</h3>
          <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
            <li>5–7 lightweight t-shirts/tank tops (linen/cotton)</li>
            <li>2–3 pairs shorts (quick-dry)</li>
            <li>2–3 swimwear (rotate for drying)</li>
            <li>1–2 light linen shirts (sun protection + evening)</li>
            <li>1 light dress/skirt (women) / 1 polo (men) for dinners</li>
            <li>1 light cardigan/hoodie (AC rooms, flights)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">🩴 Footwear</h3>
          <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
            <li>Flip-flops/sandals (daily wear)</li>
            <li>Water shoes/reef shoes (rocky beaches, sea urchins)</li>
            <li>Comfortable walking shoes (Stone Town, Jozani)</li>
            <li>Flip-flops for shower (shared bathrooms)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.8rem; color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Health & Safety Essentials</h2>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem;">
        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">💊 Medications & Health</h3>
          <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
            <li><strong>Antimalarials:</strong> Malarone or Doxycycline (consult doctor 2 weeks prior)</li>
            <li>Rehydration salts (Electral/Dioralyte) — 10+ sachets</li>
            <li>Antidiarrheal (Imodium) + antibiotics (Ciprofloxacin/Azithromycin — RX)</li>
            <li>Antihistamine (cetirizine) for bites/stings</li>
            <li>Motion sickness tablets (boat trips)</li>
            <li>Basic first aid: plasters, antiseptic wipes, antibiotic cream</li>
            <li>Personal prescriptions (in original bottles + doctor's note)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">🦟 Bite & Sun Protection</h3>
          <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
            <li>DEET 30–50% or Picaridin 20% repellent</li>
            <li>Permethrin-treated clothing (or spray your own)</li>
            <li>Mosquito net (if not provided — most hotels have them)</li>
            <li>After-bite relief (hydrocortisone cream)</li>
            <li>Reef-safe SPF 50+ (2× 200ml bottles)</li>
            <li>After-sun aloe gel</li>
            <li>Lip balm SPF 30+</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">📋 Documents & Insurance</h3>
          <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
            <li>Passport (6+ months validity)</li>
            <li>Yellow fever certificate (if transiting endemic zones)</li>
            <li><strong>Zanzibar Inbound Insurance (ZIC)</strong> — $44/adult, buy at <a href="https://inbound.visitzanzibar.go.tz" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #005f8a; text-decoration: underline;">inbound.visitzanzibar.go.tz</a></li>
            <li>Travel insurance (medical evacuation + activities)</li>
            <li>Digital + printed copies of all docs</li>
            <li>Emergency contacts (embassy, insurer, local contact)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.8rem; color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Tech & Money</h2>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem;">
        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">📱 Tech Essentials</h3>
          <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
            <li>Phone + charger (Type G UK plug adapter)</li>
            <li>Power bank 20,000mAh+ (power cuts common)</li>
            <li>Waterproof phone pouch (boat trips, beach)</li>
            <li>GoPro/underwater camera + floaty</li>
            <li>Kindle/ebooks (save luggage space)</li>
            <li>Headphones + portable speaker (check volume)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">💰 Money Strategy</h3>
          <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
            <li><strong>USD cash:</strong> $500–1000 in 2013+ series bills (no tears/marks)</li>
            <li><strong>TZS cash:</strong> Withdraw at airport ATM (best rate)</li>
            <li>No-fee debit card (Wise, Revolut, Charles Schwab)</li>
            <li>Credit card (Visa/Mastercard) for hotels/resorts</li>
            <li>Small USD bills ($1, $5, $10) for tips, markets, taxis</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">🔌 Power & Connectivity</h3>
          <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
            <li>Type G (UK) plug adapter (2–3)</li>
            <li>Power strip (multi-device charging)</li>
            <li>Power bank 20,000mAh+ (essential)</li>
            <li>Local SIM: Airtel or Zantel (buy at airport, ~$5+data)</li>
            <li>eSIM backup (Airalo, Holafly)</li>
            <li>Offline maps (Maps.me, Organic Maps)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.8rem; color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Specialized Packing Lists</h2>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem;">
        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Families with Kids</h3>
          <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
            <li>Kids' reef-safe SPF 50+ (stick for faces)</li>
            <li>Swim diapers + regular diapers</li>
            <li>Floaties/life jackets (if not strong swimmers)</li>
            <li>Familiar snacks/pouches (picky eaters)</li>
            <li>Small toys/coloring for downtime</li>
            <li>Baby carrier (Stone Town stairs, no strollers)</li>
            <li>Pediatric rehydration + fever reducer</li>
            <li>Portable blackout blind (naps in bright rooms)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">🤿 Snorkelers & Divers</h3>
          <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
            <li>Own mask/snorkel (fit + hygiene)</li>
            <li>Fins (travel fins fold flat)</li>
            <li>Rash guard / wetsuit top (2mm)</li>
            <li>Underwater camera + red filter</li>
            <li>Dive log + certification cards</li>
            <li>Reef-safe sunscreen (non-negotiable)</li>
            <li>Dry bag for boat trips</li>
            <li>Seasickness bands/patches</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">🏄 Kitesurfers (Paje/Jambiani)</h3>
          <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
            <li>Own kite(s) + bar + lines (check airline policy)</li>
            <li>Board(s) + fins + straps</li>
            <li>Harness + helmet + impact vest</li>
            <li>Wetsuit (1–2mm shorty for Dec–Mar)</li>
            <li>Booties (sharp shells/coral)</li>
            <li>Kite repair kit + spare lines</li>
            <li>Pump + pressure gauge</li>
            <li>Sunscreen stick (face, won't run in eyes)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.8rem; color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Stone Town Cultural Dress Code</h2>
      <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 1rem;">🕌 Respectful Dress for Stone Town & Villages</h3>
        <p style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Zanzibar is 99% Muslim. Modest dress shows respect and avoids unwanted attention.</p>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem;">
          <div style="background: #f0f9ff; border-left: 4px solid #005f8a; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;">
            <h4 style="color: #003853; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">✅ Do Wear</h4>
            <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">
              <li>Shoulders covered (t-shirt, not tank)</li>
              <li>Knees covered (long shorts, skirt, pants)</li>
              <li>Light scarf for women (mosque entry)</li>
              <li>Loose, breathable fabrics</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div style="background: #fef3c7; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;">
            <h4 style="color: #92400e; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">❌ Avoid</h4>
            <ul style="color: #78350f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">
              <li>Bikini/swimwear away from beach</li>
              <li>Short shorts / mini skirts</li>
              <li>Spaghetti straps / crop tops</li>
              <li>See-through fabrics</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.7; margin-top: 1rem;"><strong>Beach resorts:</strong> Bikinis, board shorts, and resort wear are completely fine on resort property and designated beaches. The dress code applies in Stone Town, villages, markets, and mosques.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

