          <li><strong>Sunscreen:</strong> Expensive, limited brands — but available in Stone Town/Nungwi pharmacies</li>
          <li><strong>Bug spray:</strong> Available everywhere</li>
          <li><strong>Basic meds:</strong> Paracetamol, ibuprofen, antihistamine in every pharmacy</li>
          <li><strong>Snorkel gear:</strong> Rental included in most tours; cheap to buy in Nungwi/Paje</li>
          <li><strong>Beach towels:</strong> Provided by all hotels/resorts</li>
          <li><strong>Hairdryer:</strong> Provided by almost all accommodation</li>
          <li><strong>Heavy guidebooks:</strong> Use offline maps + our WhatsApp concierge</li>
